    "title": "Forget Florida, Retire To Alabama's Serene Escape With Untamed Trails, Parks, And Affordable Living - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Garrett Martin ,\n6 hours ago Florida has long reigned as the unbeaten retirement champ of the U.S., but not everybody dreams of the Sunshine State. Maybe you want something a little quieter in your golden years: a little slower, a little cheaper, and less vacation-oriented. Maybe you should forget Florida and look to a place like Clarke County, Alabama, when the time comes to hang up your boots. It's not the obvious play, but it might be the right one for you — especially if you want to stretch your dollar as far as you can in a beautiful part of the country full of unspoiled nature. Read full article\n6",
